[-] hoax		<-->	n++[0]	./həʊks/-NAmE /həʊks/
	;trò lừa bịp, cú lừa -- (1) an act intended to make somebody believe something that is not true, especially something unpleasant
		;He was accused of using a bomb hoax to empty a rival restaurant.
